A path leading to the arena.
  The arena lies a short distance away from here.  It is fenced off by a well
patrolled wall leaving just this point as the sole entry to the area.  Rows of
seats are built up on a hillock alongside the arena that allows spectators to
watch the matches.  The seats are nearly always filled with cheering fans
shouting for blood.

Commands:
-- points          : retrieve the current score of the match.
-- join <blue|red> : join up for the arena game on blue|red team.
                     You may not change your allegiance once
                     signed up.
-- start           : start the arena war.  Both teams must have members,
                     but there is no other checking performed so use this
                     command cautiously.
-- abort           : clear the teams and reset the arena.  Again, no
                     checking is performed so be careful.
-- ranking         : shows the top arena gladiators.
-- ?               : shows the current status of the arena.

                   +--------------------------+
                   |Read help player-killing. |
                   |     (Zero tolerance)     |
                   +--------------------------+

