Entrance to the zoo
  This circular path wraps around a pretty pond.  Many rows of cages lead off
from this central hub.  Famous merchants have captured exotic animals and keep
them caged here on display.  The collective squawks, roars, and whistles of the
captive creatures can be heard for quite some distance from the zoo.  A little
sign is pegged into the green grass around the pond. The sky is black and the
